<stringmatch name="CALLTARGETTYPE-A64 #2: the float call itself prints as it did" min="2" max="2">return \(float\)\(\*v1\)\(a0 \+ a0\) \+ 1\.0;</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="CALLTARGETTYPE-A64 #3: on types an integer call" min="1" max="1">int \(\*v1\)\(unsigned int,unsigned int\); // pc \| x8</stringmatch>
